WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:24.850
Now, everyone.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.100
As the battles continue
day and night...

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.900
...there seems to be
more at stake now.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.360
Rather than merely being
about winning or losing...

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.190
...the Tournament has become
a furious race for survival.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:40.390
As for Domon, his next chosen
opponents in these Fights are...

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:42.660
Neo Singapore
Ashura Gundam

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.340
...Ashura Gundam of Neo Singapore...

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.330
Neo Malaysia
Skull Gundam

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.580
...and Skull Gundam of Neo Malaysia.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.580
But why would there be
two opponents?

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.040
I smell danger here.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:53.960
And now!

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.800
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:04.850
Stand Up Domon!
Raging Tag Team Match!

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:11.650
Huh?

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.560
God Gundam...?

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.740
And Nobel Gundam?

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:22.660
You set this optical
input switch diagonally.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:23.780
Right.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.910
Then, you take this chip
and place it right here.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.170
Domon!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.420
What are you two doing?!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.170
She says there's a trick
to minimizing...

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.670
...energy consumption levels
in the Hyper Mode...

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:39.840
...so I got her to show me.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:40.630
What?!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.140
Don't worry.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.390
Actually, it's top-secret stuff.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.680
But a little info won't hurt.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:47.850
Are you crazy?!

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:51.310
The fact is you're a Fighter
representing another nation.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.690
I can't have you enter our
cockpit without authorization.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:55.940
It's not that big a deal.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.030
That's right.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.240
Our fight against each other
is done.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.530
So you don't have to be so uptight.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.450
Which reminds me, Domon!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.490
You know that guy with the
Chinese buns?

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.500
The one where you bite into one,
and he says, "Tasty, yeah?"

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.830
You want to talk about buns!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.710
Get out!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.130
Rain sure is scary when
she gets mad.

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.470
Can't fool with a woman's heart.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.060
You think I did something
I shouldn't have?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.060
I don't know.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.270
Maybe you can cool off now!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.730
There's a limit to how friendly
you can get.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.370
Thanks to Wong,
we've come here for nothing.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.450
Will we find out when
God Gundam fights next?!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.660
How many days is he
going to make us wait?

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:56.790
I just hope Wong isn't planning
to do anything morally wrong.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.540
For someone so young...

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.300
...Wong sure doesn't let on
what he's thinking.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.130
What was that?

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.260
That was Schwarz.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.970
Rain! What's the matter?!

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.930
Sorry! Go ahead without me!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:48.260
One never tires of its wonder.
Don't you agree, Master East?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.100
With this Devil Gundam...

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.890
...the right to rule all of space...

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.850
...will forever remain
with Neo Hong Kong.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.400
Or rather, it'll remain with me.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.150
I agree with you.

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.110
However...

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.750
Look at him.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.960
That state that Kyoji Kasshu is in.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.170
After that fierce battle in Guyana...

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.590
...Kyoji looks like a rag doll.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:26.840
In order to fully revive
the Devil Gundam...

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.720
...we must somehow use
the next Gundam Fight...

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.760
...to our own advantage.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.560
I'm well aware of that,
Master East.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:38.060
Just leave everything to me.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.270
It's as I thought.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.110
They've retrieved the
remains of the Devil Gundam.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.940
But what does this have to do
with the Gundam Fight?

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.240
A trespasser!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.120
What the...?!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.250
Men!

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.540
After him! After him!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.550
Wh-what's going on?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:12.890
Rain.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.260
Schwarz.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.350
Watch out!

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.540
Who was that bastard?!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.150
After him!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.320
Don't let him escape!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.830
Schwarz, you hurt yourself
badly back there!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.620
Don't talk!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.830
You'll bite your tongue!

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:49.590
Those responsible for the break-ins
are heading toward Aberdeen.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.840
Police units are to
set up road blocks.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.510
Marine patrol units,
restrict access by sea.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.600
What the...?!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:10.030
Anyone who sees the secret hangar
won't leave here alive!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:10.950
You guys!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.910
You're under the command
of Master Asia?!

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.160
Silver Kick!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.370
You evil demons of hell!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.430
I'm sorry I scared you!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.470
Huh? It's okay.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.880
What's this I'm feeling?
This familiar feeling...

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:52.030
What's happening there?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.330
What the...?

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.290
What'd they do?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:08.800
He disappeared...

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.220
What?!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.760
Wh-what's going on here?

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.180
Michelo Chariot!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.440
D-Domon!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.940
So it was you!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.190
You're the one causing
this trouble!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.650
Chapman's here, too.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.870
I suggest you stay still!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.790
Undefeated of the East!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:46.920
Domon!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.540
Long time no see!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.380
So you sneaked into
the government buildings?!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.550
What're you talking about?!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.770
I see your skills have improved.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.730
Don't expect me to
remain the same forever.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.330
Forget it.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.450
All units, withdraw!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.290
You're kidding, Master!

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.250
You will do as I say!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.010
What's that about?

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.510
They were all after Schwarz.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.050
Even Michelo and
Undefeated of the East.

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.560
What the hell happened?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.650
Master East.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.150
Why are you withdrawing?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.110
He saw the one thing he
should not have seen.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.570
It seems Domon has nothing to do
with this incident.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.610
Oh?

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:01.780
I didn't expect that from you.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.870
Does your vision suddenly
become distorted...

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:07.080
...when you're dealing
with a former pupil?

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.750
There are those who do not
understand the soul of the fist!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.340
You're quite insistent about this.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:18.510
In that case, I shall
handle this matter myself.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.510
What?

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.850
We must pass judgment
on the suspicious ones...

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.810
...in the ring.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.920
What happened in the
government buildings?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.210
I cannot tell you yet.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:53.290
However...

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.290
...I will say this much.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:56.420
Beware of Wong.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.590
What?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:58.630
Prime Minister Wong?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.340
Now that it's come to this...

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.090
...I'm sure he'll take
some sort of action.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.100
Do what you can to save Domon.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.310
"Do what you can to save Domon."

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.810
As a childhood friend
you are able to help him.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.580
"As a childhood friend..."

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.070
He's talking as if...

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.400
...he's known both Domon
and me for a long time.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.360
Rain!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.410
Where did you go?

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.080
Why did Master Asia chase
you all the way out here?

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.830
What kind of stunt did you pull?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.330
N-nothing.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.210
If you don't want to tell me...

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.750
It's not that!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.050
Domon!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.420
Get this!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.260
Tomorrow's match-up
was just announced!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.510
What?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.470
You and I are going to be
a tag team?!

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:44.640
Yeah.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.430
We're doing a two-on-two
tag team match.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.350
What's going on?

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.980
Some rings are unavailable
since they're being repaired.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.810
Although it deviates from the rules...

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:59.610
...we've decided to introduce
a "double-bout" format.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.780
We hope you understand.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:06.320
So they can clear up two matches
at once using only one ring.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.160
Exactly.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.290
Everyone...

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.330
...I wish you the best of luck.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.290
Schwarz told me to
beware of Wong, but...

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:19.380
Hey, Wong...

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:20.880
What do you have up your sleeve?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:21.800
Oh?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.320
Are you not satisfied?

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.840
If you prefer...

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.850
...you may choose to forfeit all of
Neo Japan's remaining matches.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.560
You thought this through.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.390
Have it your way,
Mr. Prime Minister.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.400
Whatever you're up to...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.570
...I'll just have to fight back with
my own fists, fair and square.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.730
That's right!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.400
And what do the two of you think?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.910
We don't mind it at all.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:47.660
Do we, Boss?

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.530
No.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.910
Well, then...

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.290
...let's begin the tag-team match!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.740
<i>Under these ominous</i>
<i>and foreboding clouds</i>...

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.110
...<i>the God Gundam-Nobel Gundam</i>
<i>tag team prepare to face</i>...

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.610
...<i>the powerful tag team</i>
<i>of Neo Malaysia's Skull Gundam</i>...

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:33.080
...<i>and Neo Singapore's</i>
<i>Ashura Gundam!</i>

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.500
I'm sorry, Allenby.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.910
The Berserker System
still needs adjustments!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.880
What're you talking about?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.400
You promised me you'd
never use that again!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:44.260
Besides, with Domon on our side,
it'll be a breeze!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.720
Right, Domon?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:46.760
Uh, right!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.550
How fond they are of each other.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:53.390
But I'll take great pleasure in
putting a dent in that friendship.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.100
<i>Prime Minister Wong</i>.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.730
<i>Preparations are complete</i>.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.230
Very well.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.850
For now, proceed as planned.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.060
Mr. Wong.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:01.860
What're you up to?

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.570
I told you.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.530
Passing judgment on
the suspicious ones.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:06.780
What's that?

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.490
Here we go! Gundam Fight!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.990
Ready!

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.620
Go!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:17.830
Domon!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.080
What's the matter?

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.510
Domon, is something wrong?

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.130
I don't know!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.890
All of a sudden my
body feels heavier!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.930
What's wrong, Domon?!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:41.900
North South

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:42.860
Why, that's...!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.150
Don't tell me...!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.820
A super gravitational field?

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:48.860
Yes.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.700
God Gundam is being pulled down...

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.870
...by a force two thousand times
greater than the force of gravity.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.790
Even with his Hyper Mode...

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.580
...it's unlikely he'll be able to
move at all.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.750
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:05.040
The Gundam Fight is a
test of their skills in combat.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.670
How could you bring in
such cheap stunts?

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.340
What are you talking about?

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.430
You speak so highly of
this King of Hearts...

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.810
...that surely you believe he
can escape this danger.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:23.900
Domon!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:26.860
What is this?!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.780
This strange magnetic field
is dangerous.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.910
I must do something.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.080
What's the problem?

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.750
You haven't been looking
after your Gundam properly?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.670
God Gundam sure ain't
what it's cracked up to be.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.130
I'll take care of these two myself!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.000
Wait, Allenby!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.800
No way!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.970
Is this allowed?!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.060
Why, you!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.320
Allenby!

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.160
Has Neo Japan just given up on us?

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.260
We would never do anything
so callous and inhuman!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.460
What's going on with Domon?

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.130
I've found nothing wrong
with the system.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:29.070
I assume the problem is
caused by an external force.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.050
But what could it be?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.010
North South

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:42.460
I'm not going to...

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.400
...let myself lose this easily!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.860
Here I go!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:52.900
Say goodbye!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.200
Thunderbolt Twister!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.950
Flamethrower!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.210
Get out of the way, Allenby!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.290
D-Domon...

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.900
Allenby!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.050
Allenby! Hang in there!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.810
H-her life's in grave danger.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.560
We need to treat her now.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.520
God Gundam!

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.070
It's your turn now!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:36.490
So, you thought you were going
to sweep the Tournament, huh?

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.460
Bastards like you...

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:41.110
...must be punished,
and punished...

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:43.330
...and punished until the end!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:49.250
Until you get down on your knees!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.840
You're going to tell Allenby
to give up now?!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.800
What will happen to Domon?!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.340
She can no longer fight.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.470
<i>Wait</i>.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.710
In this match...

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.770
...Domon and I teamed up
as partners.

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.440
I'll fight to the end
no matter how it turns out.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.770
You serious?!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.020
You want to keep fighting?!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.030
Allenby!

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:20.370
I can't allow you to fight on alone!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.120
Wh-what's going on?

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.790
Domon...

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.290
Forget it.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.340
Your Hyper Mode won't get you
out of that magnetic field.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:43.720
He got up...

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.270
Domon!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.650
Allenby!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.610
Domon!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.610
Allenby!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.080
Wh-what is this?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:11.500
This light...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.710
It's the part that Allenby modified.

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:27.390
Wh-what?

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.180
Watch carefully.

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.630
That's the soul of a martial artist.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.030
Allenby saved Domon...

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:38.690
But I...

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.570
...his partner...

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.030
That guy's a monster!

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.750
We picked the wrong guy
as our enemy!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.500
Let's do it, Domon!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.620
Yeah.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.710
Let's finish this!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.670
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.880
Its loud roar tells me...

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.300
...to grasp victory!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.550
W-we're so sorry!

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.220
Erupting...

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.300
...Double...

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.810
...God Finger!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:16.060
Heat End!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.190
They did it!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.030
Domon...

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.560
Looks like your teammate
saved your hide in this match.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.250
Thank you, Allenby.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.090
I just didn't want to lose.

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.550
What the hell?!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.470
Mr. Wong...

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.260
What now, Master East?

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:48.350
I hope you never pull
such a cheap stunt again.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.390
But...

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:53.480
I can't allow anyone to get away
after seeing the secret hangar.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.230
Then what'll you do?

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.690
That's easy.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:00.190
He shall be punished in
the most extreme way...

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.990
...at the hands of his next opponents!

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:08.700
B-but they're...

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.200
<i>Everybody around the world</i>...

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.620
...<i>may I have your attention?!</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:15.250
<i>I would like to announce the</i>
<i>"Big Match" in this Gundam Fight</i>.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.040
<i>Yes</i>.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:19.500
<i>You've all seen Domon Kasshu</i>
<i>win his recent bout</i>.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.960
<i>Now he will face these</i>
<i>four Fighters one by one</i>.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:23.670
<i>Yes</i>.

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.470
<i>Each one a candidate</i>
<i>to win the championship</i>.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.720
What's that?

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.850
<i>Is it possible for him</i>
<i>to take on these Fighters</i>...

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:33.020
...<i>and still remain undefeated?</i>

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.560
<i>We shall all look forward</i>
<i>to these matches!</i>

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.400
Fighting against
my Shuffle partners?

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.450
I trust you're fine with this,
Master East?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.910
I couldn't have asked
for better match-ups.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.920
Who'll he fight first?

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.410
Let's see now.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.670
We'll put him against
Neo America's Chibodee Crocket!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.250
Well! The Tournament
has reached a new level!

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.130
Yes!

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:05.640
Domon will now be
forced to fight against those...

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.590
...who hold the same Shuffle crest!

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:12.140
Now, will Domon be able
to overcome this ordeal?!

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:28.070
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:30.570
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.870
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.410
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:43.540
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:47.220
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.180 --> 00:23:01.480
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.610
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:17.080
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:25.920
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.390
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:37.470
Though a Gundam Head
is spotted in Neo Hong Kong...

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:40.350
...the Shuffle Alliance members
focus all of their energy...

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:43.690
...on their final bouts
against Domon!

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:47.150
How will Domon
counter Chibodee...

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:49.820
...who has developed
a new technique?!

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.110
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:56.080
Showdown! Bursting Machine Gun Punch!

00:23:54.160 --> 00:24:00.970
Showdown!
Bursting Machinegun Punch!

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.120
Ready! Go!
